{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "53176968-4780-46b8-a00e-b9708da0babe",
    "name": "Tabungan Haji API",
    "description": "REST API untuk Tabungan Haji Online - BSI. Memakai JWT auth dengan role (USER/ADMIN) dan ownership nasabah-tabungan.\n\nAlur run: Login (Admin) -> Daftarkan Nasabah (Nasabah, publik: sekaligus membuat akun login) -> Login (Nasabah) -> Buka rekening -> Setor/tarik/lihat miliknya. Endpoint admin-only memakai {{admin_token}}, endpoint nasabah memakai {{token}}.\n\nPerubahan terbaru: registrasi nasabah kini PUBLIK lewat POST /api/v1/nasabah (body wajib menyertakan password; otomatis membuat baris di tabel users). Sebaliknya POST /api/v1/auth/register sekarang ADMIN-ONLY untuk membuat akun admin/staf (menerima field role).\n\nPrasyarat: seed akun admin lebih dulu via `npm run db:seed` (set ADMIN_EMAIL/ADMIN_PASSWORD di .env), lalu samakan variable admin_email/admin_password di koleksi ini.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "40180465"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Punya token\", () => pm.expect(r.data).to.have.property(\"token\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"Login lean (tanpa user)\", () => pm.expect(r.data).to.not.have.property(\"user\"));",
                  "if (r.data && r.data.token) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"admin_token\", r.data.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Profil Saya (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Role ADMIN\", () => pm.expect(r.data.role).to.eql(\"ADMIN\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"Admin tanpa profil nasabah\", () => pm.expect(r.data.nasabah).to.be.null);"
